P1000Gateway cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/services/p1000-gateway/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
P1000Gateway provides BoundedPhysicalTransport.
P1000Gateway owns ObserveSerialBytes.
ObserveSerialBytes realizes BoundedPhysicalTransport.
ObserveSerialBytes specifies "Configured passive serial input preserves bytes/order/timestamps/provenance; framing remains capture-backed.".
P1000Gateway owns BufferTargetHistory.
BufferTargetHistory realizes BoundedPhysicalTransport.
BufferTargetHistory specifies "Bounded RX across Machine disconnect; advertise session/range/count/bytes/age and overflow.".
P1000Gateway owns RecoverTargetHistory.
RecoverTargetHistory realizes BoundedPhysicalTransport.
RecoverTargetHistory specifies "Honor explicit resume/live-only/discard; internal delivery commit is not protocol ACK.".
P1000Gateway owns GatePhysicalWrite.
GatePhysicalWrite realizes BoundedPhysicalTransport.
GatePhysicalWrite specifies "Design obligation only: bounded correlated TX and end-to-end expiry, no stale replay, no autonomous ACK. Physical execution is disabled in this exercise.".
P1000Gateway owns ReportGatewayHealth.
ReportGatewayHealth realizes BoundedPhysicalTransport.
ReportGatewayHealth specifies "Expose counters/reconnect diagnostics; MachineService restart does not require restarting serial observation.".
